sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant Q as cuda::pipeline<br/>2 stages
    participant S as Shared memory<br/>Stage 0 / Stage 1
    participant C as Consumer

    P->>Q: producer_acquire() · S0 for k
    P->>S: cuda::memcpy_async(…, pipeline)
    P->>Q: producer_commit()
    C->>Q: consumer_wait() → S0 ready
    par consume Stage 0
        C->>S: consume k from S0
    and fill Stage 1
        P->>Q: producer_acquire() · S1 for k+1
        P->>S: cuda::memcpy_async(…, pipeline)
        P->>Q: producer_commit()
    end
    C->>Q: consumer_release() · Stage 0
    P->>Q: producer_acquire() → S0 for k+2
